// An optional parameter is named at the call site (§4.2), and a dispatch
// site has no name to give: the call goes through a vtable slot. So a
// default cannot work through an interface, and it is refused where it is
// written rather than misbehaving at the call.
interface Get { int of(int a); }
Get g = (int a = 2) => a;
print(g.of(1));
